# Sentry

- Set `SENTRY_DSN` on Railway `web` and `worker`.
- Wrap Nitro handlers and job processors with spans named after the use case / route.
- Tag `organizationId` / `projectId` when known; avoid unnecessary PII.
- Capture unexpected infra failures; expected domain `Result` errors are not Sentry events unless they indicate bugs.
- On ledger-related incidents follow `docs/runbooks/incident-sentry.md`.

Use installed Sentry agent skills when configuring the SDK.
